OL,3,AChristian metal band Demon Hunter sue
OL,4,ANetflix over KPop Demon Hunters
OL,5,
OL,6,FChristian metal band Demon Hunter are
OL,7,Fsuing Netflix in a trademark lawsuit
OL,8,Fover the streamer's hit film Kpop Demon
OL,9,FHunters.
OL,11,FThe US group, who have been releasing
OL,12,Fmusic and touring for 25 years, said
OL,13,FNetflix's plan for a global concert
OL,14,Ftour, along with the movie and
OL,15,Fmerchandise, means there is "almost
OL,16,Fcomplete overlap" with their offerings.
OL,18,FFiled on Tuesday by the band's company
OL,19,FHyde Lane, the complaint claims Netflix
OL,20,FStudios and live promoter AEG Presents
OL,21,Fhave caused "substantial confusion"
OL,22,Famong consumers.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
