OL,3,AChristian metal band Demon Hunter sue
OL,4,ANetflix over KPop Demon Hunters
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey included email evidence from
OL,7,Fsomeone who allegedly spent $500 on
OL,8,Ftickets for a Demon Hunter concert in
OL,9,FNew York, thinking it was a
OL,10,Fchild-friendly Kpop show for their
OL,11,Fsmall children.
